Z||000001||SLYGUY||10-27-2001||08:57 PM||||Did you clear the ECM of all codes first?<BR>Make sure to disconnect the negative battery cable for at least 15 seconds ( I wait a minute) and then reconnect. <BR>That will give you fresh codes if there is something wrong. <P>Sly<P>||||reg||1
